# No automatic release

Agents must not ship qiick Excubia (`qiick/excubia-core`) to `main` without an explicit user request. `develop` is the integration branch. `main` is for releases.

## Allowed

- Open a `develop` → `main` release pull request when the user asks for a release
- Stop after that pull request is open

## Forbidden unless the user explicitly asks

- Merge a release pull request (`develop` → `main`)
- Create git tags (`vX.Y.Z` or otherwise)
- Run `gh release create` or publish a GitHub Release
- Push to `main` to cut a release
- Publish `qiick/excubia-core` to Packagist

Claiming the Packagist vendor `qiick` and the trademark search before `v0.1.0` are human steps (`docs/SPEC.md` D5 and D13).
